    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Au lieu de bois ou de brique, il a construit sa maison avec du bacon de chalet, ce qui est : ",
      "n": "QuestionText2"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Before",
      "n": "BumperPlacement"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "I live in constant fear there’s a fourth little pig that we never talk about.",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Hamibilisme ! ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "737473_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "(très sarcastique) Oui... ses propres fesses. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "737485_2",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "737476_1",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "C'est trop sombre pour une viande blanche. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "737483_6",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "Quel gaspillage de porcs. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "737481_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Cottage bacon comes from a pig’s shoulder.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "737478_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "I was already suspicious of a story where pigs knew how to work with wood and bricks, but this was the last straw.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "737479_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "I live in constant fear there’s a fourth little pig that we never talk about. Instead of wood or brick, he built his house out of cottage bacon, which is:",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "737475_3",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
